<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carolina Power, FPL Group.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carolina Power, FPL Group.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney analyst William Tilles downgraded Carolina Power &amp; Light Co and FPL Group Inc to neutral from outperform, his office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Carolina Power was cut due to its stock price and lower earnings estimates, the office said.</p>
<p>-- FPL Group was lowered due to its stock price.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Carolina Power fell 1/8 to 35-1/2 and FPL Group rose 1/8 to 47-3/4 in early trading.</p>
</text>
